- **Budget** — Kafka at this scale (Confluent Cloud or MSK) starts at ~$400/month. Redis Streams shares the existing Redis instance at no incremental infra cost.

The recommendation is definitive: **Redis Streams**. Kafka is the right tool at higher scale or with a dedicated platform team; neither condition applies here.
